  "composedQuest": {
    "stories": 21,
    "results": [
      "Disabled, unsigned, forged, oversized and nonmember requests fail closed, and browser roles cannot call or read the SQL store",
      "Connecting and entering WebXR make no private request, and an account check alone does not register a seat",
      "An independent regular browser and simulated headset see the same two seats, with one seat per member and no cross-member control",
      "A browser and a headset load the selected Reel, review their edited drafts, and see each other\u2019s exact posts on the next check-in",
      "Reviewing older headset posts pauses discussion updates and returning to the salon retains the same seat",
      "A starter week without a pinned edition offers the regular Circle and keeps the shared seat",
      "An explicit headset leave removes its seat and the other browser observes the smaller count",
      "Removing the headset member closes the shared discussion on the next heartbeat and clears its private draft",
      "Headset focus loss clears the screen and retires a late reservation without activating it",
